Dexterous Hand Paper Digest

Project: https://github.com/suyoutzy/dexterous-paper-digest

This project provides a daily research digest for dexterous end-effector
design and control. It collects public scholarly metadata, scores titles
and abstracts with DeepSeek, and delivers selected papers to Feishu.

The daily selection consists of up to four highest-ranked qualifying
papers and one additional qualifying journal paper. It stores metadata
and delivery records without downloading PDFs or full-text content.

Runtime entry point: python -m daily_digest
